    summary: 'The Order of the Solar Temple (Ordre du Temple Solaire, OTS) was a secretive neo-Templar esoteric new religious movement founded in 1984 by Luc Jouret (a Belgian homeopathic physician) and Joseph Di Mambro (a French occult financier). Blending Western hermeticism, apocalyptic environmentalism, and theatrical Templar rituals, the leadership extracted millions from wealthy European followers before orchestrating a series of synchronized murder-suicides between 1994 and 1997 across Switzerland, Canada, and France, claiming members were embarking on a cosmic "transit" to the star Sirius.',
